member.remarks:
This method performs the following tasks on the digital pattern instrument: 


            
            Clears over-temperature and over-power conditions;
            
            


            
            Aborts pattern execution;
            
            


            
            Clears pin maps, time sets, source and capture waveforms, and patterns;
            
            


            
            Resets all properties to default values, including setting   to , causing the I/O switches to open; and
            
            


            
            Stops export of all external signals and events.

example.code:
  // Individual channel.
  DigitalPinSet ch0 = session.PinAndChannelMap.GetPinSet("0");

  // List of channels.
  DigitalPinSet channels = session.PinAndChannelMap.GetPinSet("0, 1, 2");

  // Individual pin.
  DigitalPinSet vcc = session.PinAndChannelMap.GetPinSet("DUTPin1");

  // List of pins.
  DigitalPinSet pins = session.PinAndChannelMap.GetPinSet("DUTPin1, DUTPin2, DUTPin3");

  // Individual pin group.
  DigitalPinSet pg1 = session.PinAndChannelMap.GetPinSet("pinGroup1");

  // List of pin groups.
  DigitalPinSet pinGroups = session.PinAndChannelMap.GetPinSet("pinGroup1, pinGroup2, pinGroup3");

  // Site-specific pins.
  DigitalPinSet pins2 = session.PinAndChannelMap.GetPinSet("site0/DUTPin1, site1/DUTPin1");

